# HR Analytics – Employee Attrition Analysis

## Project Overview
This project analyzes employee attrition using Microsoft Excel and the IBM HR Analytics Employee Attrition dataset. The objective is to understand employee turnover, identify workforce patterns, and generate useful HR insights through data analysis.

## Dataset
- Dataset: IBM HR Analytics Employee Attrition
- Total Records: 1,470 employees
- Key attributes: Age, Department, Job Role, Monthly Income, Years at Company, Overtime, and Attrition.

## Tools and Technologies
- Microsoft Excel
- Excel Tables
- Excel Formulas
- Data Cleaning
- Conditional Formatting
- KPI Analysis

## Project Structure
```text
